```
public static int sum(int n) {
    if (n == 1) {
        return 1;
    } else {
        return n + sum(n - 1);
    }
}
```
This function uses recursion to add the current value of n to the sum of the previous integers (n-1, n-2, ..., 1). The recursion stops when n reaches 1, which is the base case.
