However, identifying metaphors and similes is a more complex task that requires natural language processing techniques such as part-of-speech tagging and semantic analysis. Here's an example of how you could modify the code to extract metaphors and similes:
import java.util.regex.Matcher;
import java.util.regex.Pattern;
import edu.stanford.nlp.simple.*;
public class WritingStyleAnalyzer {
